{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/3599-malleus-maleficarum-alternative-endowment","id":3599,"title":"Malleus Maleficarum [Alternative Endowment]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-05T10:26:13-08:00","id":3599,"title":"Malleus Maleficarum [Alternative Endowment]","content":"Migrated from the old White Wolf Forum. <hr />I love the Maleficarum, I've used them in several games and the conspiracy is central to the overarcing plot of one my major story-lines. Their whole religious zeal, paladin-o-god angle makes for fun NPCs. <br /> <br /> Unfortunately I do not love their endowment. It's not that Benediction is bad, in any other format the whole 'Feast Days' mechanic could really work. But in table top RP I've found it to be heavy handed, book keeping-tastic, and puts a strain on the GM to constantly track not only the exact time of year, but the precise date as well. Quite the headache.<br /> <br /> I've made mention of this before, occasionally mumbled about replacing it. Now enough people have asked to see what I use instead, so here it is:<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1oaRHmlrDUiiRHCCtEeAHDQwMpypajRXIthd_uxnHeLg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Gospels: Hymn &amp; Benediction</a></span></b><br /> <br /> It's a bit too long to put in post, so I'll use G-Docs instead. But here's the gist:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> To better do battle with the devil and his servants, paladins of the Malleus Maleficarum use holy songs called Gospels. These divine magics are broken down into two categories, Benedictions and Hymns. Benedictions are short prayers, no longer than a sentence or two, from which paladins draw power. Each provides a brief boon that, while weak, may turn the tide in conflict. <br /> <br /> Hymns are elaborate sermons, songs that glorify the one true God and the works of his saints. When invoked as a Hymn Gospels possess impressive power, creating miracles that rival the might of the Maleficarum\u2019s satanic foes. But the magic of Hymns cannot be unlocked by a lone believer, only with the assistance of a choir can a paladin hope to call upon true divinity. </div> </div> </div>Included are rewrites of nearly every Benediction, altered mechanics, and a brand new merit. Compatable with both nWoD 1.0 and GMC (though it is intended for GMC). As always feedback is appreciated, constructive criticism especially. Thanks in advance, Enjoy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}